# §2026-02-14 + §2026-02-15 + §2026-05-16 — DO NOT re-add `.env` exclusions.
# `.env` files (backend/.env, frontend/.env) MUST stay tracked so the
# Emergent "Save to GitHub" + Redeploy flow ships them to production.
# Iter 82, 85, and the May-15 incident all confirmed that re-adding
# `.env`, `.env.*`, or `*.env` to this file caused 24h+ production
# outages (ELEVENLABS_API_KEY + agent IDs missing → 503 from
# /api/clarity/convai/signed-url → no Chrome profile could open a
# ConvAI session). Secret rotation belongs in the Emergent Deploy
# panel's Environment Variables section IN ADDITION to the repo.
#
# If an auto-tool re-adds any of the patterns below, REMOVE them
# immediately:
#   .env
#   .env.*
#   *.env

# Generic credential / certificate exclusions (NOT .env-related):
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
*token.json*
*credentials.json*
.credentials
frontend/node_modules/.cache/default-development/1.pack
